popular formats, and relevant topics can improve discoverability by promoting content users currently enjoy.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Consistency and Posting Frequency<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Creators who post Reels consistently are more likely to receive stable engagement and greater visibility in the Reels and Explore sections.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Keywords and SEO&nbsp;Optimization<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram analyses captions, hashtags, text overlays, and audio keywords to understand Reel topics and recommend them to relevant audiences.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Audience Retention Matters Most<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Reels&nbsp;that keep users watching longer send strong positive signals to the algorithm, helping content appear on more users\u2019 feeds consistently.&nbsp;Choosing the right hashtags&nbsp;remains&nbsp;an important part of Reel discoverability.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How does the Instagram Feed Algorithm Work?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram\u2019s Feed algorithm ranks posts based on user interests, engagement history, content relevance, activity patterns, and relationships to deliver&nbsp;personalized&nbsp;and engaging content experiences daily. Now, present below are some steps that tell you&nbsp;how the Instagram feed Algorithm works:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work.webp\" alt=\"How does the Instagram Feed Algorithm Work\" class=\"wp-image-19757\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-does-instagram-feed-algorithm-work-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Instagram Collects User Activity Data<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram tracks&nbsp;like&nbsp;comments, shares, saves, watch time, profile visits, and interaction history to understand what users prefer seeing in their Feed.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Relationship Signals Are&nbsp;Analyzed<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The algorithm&nbsp;prioritizes&nbsp;posts from accounts users&nbsp;frequently&nbsp;interact with through comments, direct messages, Story replies, and regular engagement activities.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Content Relevance Is Measured<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram analyses captions, hashtags, keywords, visuals, and engagement patterns to&nbsp;determine&nbsp;whether content matches a user\u2019s interests and browsing&nbsp;behaviour.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Engagement Predictions Are Made<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The platform predicts how likely users are to like, comment on, save, share, or spend time viewing a specific post in the Feed.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Fresh Content Gets Priority<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Recently uploaded posts&nbsp;receive&nbsp;temporary visibility boosts because Instagram prefers showing updated and trending content to active users first.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Feed Ranking Happens Automatically<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>After&nbsp;analyzing&nbsp;all ranking signals, Instagram arranges Feed posts based on relevance, engagement potential, and user interest for&nbsp;personalized&nbsp